@baseUrl = https://localhost:5001
@participantId = 1
@questionnaireId = 1
@questionnaireAssignmentId = 1
@hoursQuestionId = 1
@devicesQuestionId = 2
@tabletBrandQuestionId = 3
@textQuestionId = 4
@smartphoneOptionId = 1
@laptopOptionId = 2
@tabletOptionId = 3
@appleOptionId = 4

### POC API call order
### 1. Run Scripts/SeedQuestionnairePocData.sql first to create questionnaire/questions/options.
### 2. Create participant through API so PII is encrypted by EF Core.
### 3. Assign questionnaire to participant.
### 4. Submit answers.
### 5. Complete assignment.
### 6. Review responses and audit logs.

### Get all questionnaires
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/questionnaires
Accept: application/json

### Get questionnaire details
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/questionnaires/{{questionnaireId}}
Accept: application/json

### Create participant
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/participants
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "John",
  "lastName": "Doe",
  "emailAddress": "john.doe@example.com",
  "dateOfBirth": "1990-01-15T00:00:00",
  "participantCode": "P001",
  "startDate": "2026-01-01T00:00:00"
}

### Get participants
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/participants
Accept: application/json

### Assign questionnaire to participant
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/questionnaire-assignments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "participantId": {{participantId}},
  "questionnaireId": {{questionnaireId}},
  "assignedDate": "2026-01-01T00:00:00Z"
}

### Get assignments for participant
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/questionnaire-assignments/participant/{{participantId}}
Accept: application/json

### Submit numeric response: How many hours per day do you spend online?
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/question-responses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "questionnaireAssignmentId": {{questionnaireAssignmentId}},
  "questionId": {{hoursQuestionId}},
  "numericValue": 8,
  "selectedQuestionOptionIds": []
}

### Submit multi-select response: Which devices do you use?
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/question-responses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "questionnaireAssignmentId": {{questionnaireAssignmentId}},
  "questionId": {{devicesQuestionId}},
  "selectedQuestionOptionIds": [{{smartphoneOptionId}}, {{laptopOptionId}}, {{tabletOptionId}}]
}

### Submit single-select response: Which tablet brand do you use?
### This question should be shown only because Tablet was selected above.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/question-responses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "questionnaireAssignmentId": {{questionnaireAssignmentId}},
  "questionId": {{tabletBrandQuestionId}},
  "selectedQuestionOptionIds": [{{appleOptionId}}]
}

### Submit text response: What improvements would you like?
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/question-responses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "questionnaireAssignmentId": {{questionnaireAssignmentId}},
  "questionId": {{textQuestionId}},
  "textValue": "Better search and recommendations.",
  "selectedQuestionOptionIds": []
}

### Get responses for assignment
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/question-responses/assignment/{{questionnaireAssignmentId}}
Accept: application/json

### Complete questionnaire assignment
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/questionnaire-assignments/{{questionnaireAssignmentId}}/complete
Accept: application/json

### Get audit logs
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/audit-logs
Accept: application/json
